Caveats and maintenance

Keep Chrome and chromedriver versions aligned; either auto-fetch (as shown) or pin and update together.

Security: building Chrome inside CI images means periodic rebuilds to get security patches. Automate rebuilds or base on an image you control.

If you need VNC / visible session for debugging, consider adding a VNC server or use selenium/standalone-chrome images which already include VNC. Otherwise for CI headless mode is recommended.

